prompt:
Use case: style-transfer.
Asset type: NURI companion-animal app Today Weather hero, revised AUTUMN NORMAL WEATHER DAY concept, ONE standalone square illustration.
Input images:
Image 1 is the edit target: the new autumn riverside bench/terrace scene. Its autumn river landscape is the composition starting point, but the HUMAN MUST BE ENTIRELY REMOVED.
Image 2 is a STYLE AND MATERIAL REFERENCE ONLY: existing NURI illustration. Precisely aim for its plush tactile fur, soft rounded animal forms, charming animated-film 3D storybook rendering, luminous clean atmospheric depth, and gently polished surface detail. Do not copy its lake picnic composition. Not a photograph, not documentary realism, not realistic human styling.
Primary request: remake image 1 into a PETS-ONLY cozy autumn scene, with all ten animal categories in the NURI app represented. No human, no human face, hands, body, mannequin, human silhouette, caretaker, human clothing figure or anthropomorphic standing animals.
Scene: an elegant sheltered wooden garden terrace looking out over a winding river and copper-red-gold maple woodland. Preserve the autumn river vista and upper-right maple branches, but rework the old bench into a comfortable low pet window-seat and woven cushion cluster, without a human-sized central seat. A small covered nook protects the little companions. Autumn leaves scattered tastefully, no spring flowers.
Subjects, EACH visibly identifiable and anatomically coherent:
1 one fluffy golden retriever;
2 one round-cheeked gray-and-white cat;
3 one cream lop-eared rabbit;
4 one tiny golden hamster with short rounded ears;
5 one white-and-caramel guinea pig;
6 one slender sable ferret with its recognizable dark face mask;
7 one petite yellow-and-green budgerigar perched on the back rail;
8 one orange goldfish INSIDE a small but spacious rectangular planted glass aquarium with visible water, stable on a side ledge, never floating in air or lying outside water;
9 one small land tortoise with patterned shell;
10 one warm-yellow leopard gecko with spotted body and recognizable curled tail, on a flat warm stone;
11 one friendly little hedgehog with fine soft spines.
Compose the species as a naturally nested affectionate ensemble in two depth layers around the low seat, primarily middle-right and across the middle-lower image. It must not look like a grid, sticker collection, lineup, zoo, contact sheet or icon catalog. Make the large dog/cat main anchors and small animals clearly visible with enough separation to identify each. Use gentle three-quarter faces and some pets looking toward one another; they should feel cute and alive, not all backs and not human expressions. Natural believable relative sizes, allowing the small companions clear visibility. Warm small dark eyes, soft noses, no exaggerated giant cartoon eyes, no aggressive or fearful expressions.
Composition for the real app: square 1:1 full bleed; upper-left approximately 40% width x 40% height is calm medium-blue open sky/distant scenery, RESERVED FOR APP WHITE WEATHER TEXT, with no actual text printed. Put all recognizable animal heads above the bottom blending area (roughly above 75% image height). Bottom-most 20% is only soft blue-gray deck and low-contrast fallen leaves, no important pets, so the app's existing pale blue fade can continue naturally. No baked white strip, UI, border, frame, text, numbers, logo, watermark or extra decorative orbs.
Lighting: crisp clear autumn daylight with warm leaf-edge light, cool medium-blue sky and river. Balance copper/crimson foliage with blues and muted greens. No rain, no snow. The image should feel like the supplied existing NURI illustration in its tactile animated-film QUALITY, but a distinct pets-only autumn composition.

